{"seq":2,"slug":"liveblocks-and-platforms","title":"Liveblocks 与协作平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/production-ready/liveblocks-and-platforms","wordCount":2297,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"liveblocks-与协作平台\">Liveblocks 与协作平台</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>现代协作平台让初创团队可以在几天而非几个月内交付协作功能。主流方案包括：Liveblocks（专注 React、基于 CRDT/Yjs）、PartyKit（基于 Cloudflare 边缘计算）、Convex（全栈实时数据库）、Replicache（后端无关的同步引擎）、Pusher / Ably（实时消息广播）。每个平台抽象了不同的层级——Liveblocks 提供预构建的 React Hooks 用于光标、选区和共享状态；PartyKit 提供边缘实时后端；Convex 提供带实时查询的全栈方案；Replicache 提供本地优先架构配合自定义后端；Pusher / Ably 提供简单的消息通道。本节将对比各平台、帮助选择合适的框架，并分析成本和自托管与平台托管的决策。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>抽象层级</th>\n<th>React 友好度</th>\n<th>成本（每月活用户）</th>\n<th>可自托管？</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Liveblocks</td>\n<td>预构建 React Hooks</td>\n<td>极强</td>\n<td>$30-200/千月活用户</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PartyKit</td>\n<td>边缘后端</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>有免费额度</td>\n<td>开源可自托管</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Convex</td>\n<td>全栈数据库</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>有免费额度</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Replicache</td>\n<td>同步引擎</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>按开发者席位收费</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pusher</td>\n<td>消息通道</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>$50-500/百万消息</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ably</td>\n<td>消息通道</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>$50-500/百万消息</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Yjs (自建)</td>\n<td>CRDT 库</td>\n<td>需要自行配置</td>\n<td>自托管成本</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"liveblocks\">Liveblocks</h2><p><strong>面向 React 的现代协作平台</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>预构建 Hooks（useOthers、useMyPresence、useStorage）。</li>\n<li>内置 Yjs 集成。</li>\n<li>光标、选区、共享状态开箱即用。</li>\n<li>托管式基础设施，无需自建服务器。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>安装配置</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm i @liveblocks/client @liveblocks/react\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @liveblocks/client</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @liveblocks/react</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"import { createClient } from &#39;@liveblocks/client&#39;;&#10;import { createRoomContext } from &#39;@liveblocks/react&#39;;&#10;&#10;const client = createClient({&#10;  authEndpoint: &#39;/api/liveblocks-auth&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;const { RoomProvider, useOthers, useMyPresence } = createRoomContext(client);&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;RoomProvider id=&quot;room-1&quot; initialPresence={{ cursor: null }}&gt;&#10;      &lt;Editor /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/RoomProvider&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function Editor() {&#10;  const [myPresence, updateMyPresence] = useMyPresence();&#10;  const others = useOthers();&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div onMouseMove={(e) =&gt; updateMyPresence({ cursor: { x: e.clientX, y: e.clientY } })}&gt;&#10;      &lt;Cursor cursor={myPresence.cursor} /&gt;&#10;      {others.map((other) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;Cursor key={other.connectionId} cursor={other.presence.cursor} /&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { createClient } from '@liveblocks/client';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { createRoomContext } from '@liveblocks/react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const client = createClient({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  authEndpoint: '/api/liveblocks-auth',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const { RoomProvider, useOthers, useMyPresence } = createRoomContext(client);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;RoomProvider id=\"room-1\" initialPresence={{ cursor: null }}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Editor /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/RoomProvider></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Editor() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [myPresence, updateMyPresence] = useMyPresence();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const others = useOthers();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div onMouseMove={(e) => updateMyPresence({ cursor: { x: e.clientX, y: e.clientY } })}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Cursor cursor={myPresence.cursor} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {others.map((other) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Cursor key={other.connectionId} cursor={other.presence.cursor} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>认证端点</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// /api/liveblocks-auth&#10;import { authorize } from &#39;@liveblocks/node&#39;;&#10;&#10;export async function POST(req) {&#10;  const userId = await getUser(req);&#10;  return authorize({&#10;    room: req.body.room,&#10;    userId,&#10;    userInfo: { name: &#39;Alice&#39;, color: &#39;#ff0000&#39; },&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// /api/liveblocks-auth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { authorize } from '@liveblocks/node';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export async function POST(req) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const userId = await getUser(req);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return authorize({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    room: req.body.room,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    userId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    userInfo: { name: 'Alice', color: '#ff0000' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>定价模型</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>免费额度支持 100 月活用户。</li>\n<li>超出部分按每千月活用户计费。</li>\n<li>价格区间 $30-200/千月活用户。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>初创团队需要快速交付协作功能。</li>\n<li>以 React 为主的技术栈。</li>\n<li>不希望自建和维护实时基础设施。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"partykit\">PartyKit</h2><p><strong>基于 Cloudflare 的实时边缘后端</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>构建于持久对象(Durable Objects)之上。</li>\n<li>边缘部署，全球低延迟。</li>\n<li>开源项目（可在 Cloudflare 上自托管）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>安装配置</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm i partykit partysocket\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> partykit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> partysocket</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>服务端</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// party/server.ts&#10;export default class implements Party.Server {&#10;  constructor(readonly room: Party.Room) {}&#10;&#10;  onConnect(connection) {&#10;    this.room.broadcast(`User ${connection.id} joined`);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  onMessage(message, sender) {&#10;    this.room.broadcast(message, [sender.id]);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// party/server.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export default class implements Party.Server {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  constructor(readonly room: Party.Room) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  onConnect(connection) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.room.broadcast(`User ${connection.id} joined`);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  onMessage(message, sender) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.room.broadcast(message, [sender.id]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>客户端</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import PartySocket from &#39;partysocket&#39;;&#10;&#10;const socket = new PartySocket({ host: &#39;http://...&#39;, room: &#39;room1&#39; });&#10;&#10;socket.send(&#39;hello&#39;);&#10;socket.addEventListener(&#39;message&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(event.data);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import PartySocket from 'partysocket';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const socket = new PartySocket({ host: 'http://...', room: 'room1' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>socket.send('hello');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>socket.addEventListener('message', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log(event.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>免费额度</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>免费额度较为慷慨。</li>\n<li>支持边缘部署。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要边缘实时计算能力。</li>\n<li>已在 Cloudflare 生态中。</li>\n<li>偏好开源和可自托管的方案。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"convex\">Convex</h2><p><strong>全栈实时数据库(Real-time DB)</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数据库 + 无服务器函数 + 实时订阅一体化。</li>\n<li>提供 React Hooks 实现实时查询。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>安装配置</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm i convex&#10;npx convex dev\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> convex</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> convex</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>数据模型与函数定义</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// convex/messages.js&#10;export const list = query(async ({ db }) =&gt; {&#10;  return await db.query(&#39;messages&#39;).take(100);&#10;});&#10;&#10;export const send = mutation(async ({ db }, { text }) =&gt; {&#10;  await db.insert(&#39;messages&#39;, { text });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// convex/messages.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const list = query(async ({ db }) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return await db.query('messages').take(100);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export const send = mutation(async ({ db }, { text }) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await db.insert('messages', { text });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>React 集成</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"import { useQuery, useMutation } from &#39;convex/react&#39;;&#10;&#10;function Chat() {&#10;  const messages = useQuery(api.messages.list); // 自动实时更新！&#10;  const send = useMutation(api.messages.send);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;&gt;&#10;      {messages?.map((m) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;p&gt;{m.text}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; send({ text: &#39;hi&#39; })}&gt;Send&lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { useQuery, useMutation } from 'convex/react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Chat() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const messages = useQuery(api.messages.list); // 自动实时更新！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const send = useMutation(api.messages.send);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {messages?.map((m) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;p>{m.text}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={() => send({ text: 'hi' })}>Send&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>数据订阅由平台自动管理，开发者无需手动处理 WebSocket 连接或状态同步。</p>\n<p><strong>适用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要全栈解决方案。</li>\n<li>不希望分别管理数据库和实时通信层。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"replicache\">Replicache</h2><p><strong>后端无关的本地优先同步引擎</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数据存储在本地 IndexedDB 中。</li>\n<li>推送待处理的变更(mutation)到服务器。</li>\n<li>从服务器拉取权威状态。</li>\n<li>内置乐观更新机制。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>安装配置</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm i replicache\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> replicache</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>客户端</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { Replicache } from &#39;replicache&#39;;&#10;&#10;const rep = new Replicache({&#10;  name: &#39;user1&#39;,&#10;  pushURL: &#39;/api/push&#39;,&#10;  pullURL: &#39;/api/pull&#39;,&#10;  mutators: {&#10;    addTodo: async (tx, { id, text }) =&gt; {&#10;      await tx.put(`todo/${id}`, { text });&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 乐观更新——立即反映在 UI 上&#10;await rep.mutate.addTodo({ id: &#39;1&#39;, text: &#39;hi&#39; });&#10;&#10;// 订阅数据变化&#10;rep.subscribe(async (tx) =&gt; tx.scan(), {&#10;  onData: (data) =&gt; render(data),&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { Replicache } from 'replicache';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const rep = new Replicache({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: 'user1',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pushURL: '/api/push',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pullURL: '/api/pull',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mutators: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    addTodo: async (tx, { id, text }) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await tx.put(`todo/${id}`, { text });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 乐观更新——立即反映在 UI 上</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await rep.mutate.addTodo({ id: '1', text: 'hi' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 订阅数据变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>rep.subscribe(async (tx) => tx.scan(), {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  onData: (data) => render(data),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>服务端端点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>/api/push</code>：接收并应用客户端变更。</li>\n<li><code>/api/pull</code>：返回权威状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>定价模型</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按开发者席位收费。</li>\n<li>不按月活用户计费。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>追求本地优先(Local-first)架构。</li>\n<li>已有自定义后端。</li>\n<li>不希望被厂商锁定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"pusher-ably\">Pusher / Ably</h2><p><strong>实时消息通道服务</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>客户端订阅频道。</li>\n<li>服务端发布消息。</li>\n<li>所有订阅者实时收到推送。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Pusher 示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import Pusher from &#39;pusher-js&#39;;&#10;&#10;const pusher = new Pusher(&#39;app-key&#39;);&#10;const channel = pusher.subscribe(&#39;chat&#39;);&#10;channel.bind(&#39;message&#39;, (data) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(data);&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 服务端发布消息&#10;pusher.trigger(&#39;chat&#39;, &#39;message&#39;, { text: &#39;hello&#39; });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import Pusher from 'pusher-js';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const pusher = new Pusher('app-key');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const channel = pusher.subscribe('chat');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>channel.bind('message', (data) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 服务端发布消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pusher.trigger('chat', 'message', { text: 'hello' });</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>通知推送和扇出分发。</li>\n<li>实时信息流。</li>\n<li>不涉及协作编辑（无 CRDT 支持）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>成本</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按消息量计费。</li>\n<li>每百万条消息 $50-500。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"yjs-自建方案\">Yjs 自建方案</h2><p><strong>完全自主控制</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 Yjs CRDT 库。</li>\n<li>配合 y-websocket 或 HocusPocus 服务器。</li>\n<li>自定义 UI 集成。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>技术栈</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm i yjs y-websocket\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> yjs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> y-websocket</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>服务端</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { WebSocketServer } from &#39;ws&#39;;&#10;import { setupWSConnection } from &#39;y-websocket/bin/utils&#39;;&#10;&#10;const wss = new WebSocketServer({ port: 1234 });&#10;wss.on(&#39;connection&#39;, setupWSConnection);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { WebSocketServer } from 'ws';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { setupWSConnection } from 'y-websocket/bin/utils';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const wss = new WebSocketServer({ port: 1234 });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wss.on('connection', setupWSConnection);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>客户端</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import * as Y from &#39;yjs&#39;;&#10;import { WebsocketProvider } from &#39;y-websocket&#39;;&#10;&#10;const doc = new Y.Doc();&#10;const provider = new WebsocketProvider(&#39;ws://localhost:1234&#39;, &#39;room&#39;, doc);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import * as Y from 'yjs';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { WebsocketProvider } from 'y-websocket';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const doc = new Y.Doc();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const provider = new WebsocketProvider('ws://localhost:1234', 'room', doc);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>完全掌控技术栈。</li>\n<li>无厂商锁定。</li>\n<li>完全开源。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>劣势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要自行管理扩容。</li>\n<li>需要自行构建所有用户体验层。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"决策框架\">决策框架</h2><p><strong>选择 Liveblocks 的条件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>技术栈以 React 为主。</li>\n<li>需要预构建的光标/状态 Hooks。</li>\n<li>接受托管模式。</li>\n<li>预算充足。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>选择 PartyKit 的条件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>已在 Cloudflare 生态中。</li>\n<li>需要边缘部署能力。</li>\n<li>偏好开源方案。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>选择 Convex 的条件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要全栈解决方案。</li>\n<li>实时查询是核心需求。</li>\n<li>不希望管理服务器。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>选择 Replicache 的条件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>坚持本地优先原则。</li>\n<li>已有自定义后端。</li>\n<li>不希望被厂商锁定。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>选择 Pusher / Ably 的条件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>仅需实时消息推送。</li>\n<li>不涉及协作编辑（无需 CRDT）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>选择 Yjs 自建的条件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要完全掌控。</li>\n<li>有足够的工程资源。</li>\n<li>有特殊需求（隐私、私有化部署）。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[构建协作功能] --&gt; B{需要预构建的用户体验？}&#10;    B -- 是 --&gt; C{接受托管？}&#10;    C -- 是 --&gt; D[Liveblocks]&#10;    C -- 否 --&gt; E[PartyKit]&#10;    B -- 否 --&gt; F{本地优先？}&#10;    F -- 是 --&gt; G[Replicache]&#10;    F -- 否 --&gt; H{需要全栈方案？}&#10;    H -- 是 --&gt; I[Convex]&#10;    H -- 否 --&gt; J[Yjs 自建]\">graph TD\n    A[构建协作功能] --&gt; B{需要预构建的用户体验？}\n    B -- 是 --&gt; C{接受托管？}\n    C -- 是 --&gt; D[Liveblocks]\n    C -- 否 --&gt; E[PartyKit]\n    B -- 否 --&gt; F{本地优先？}\n    F -- 是 --&gt; G[Replicache]\n    F -- 否 --&gt; H{需要全栈方案？}\n    H -- 是 --&gt; I[Convex]\n    H -- 否 --&gt; J[Yjs 自建]</pre><h2 id=\"定价对比\">定价对比</h2><p><strong>Liveblocks</strong>（托管模式）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每千月活用户 $30-200。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>PartyKit</strong>（Cloudflare 托管）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按持久对象请求数 + WebSocket 消息数计费。</li>\n<li>有免费额度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Convex</strong>（托管模式）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有一定的免费额度。</li>\n<li>按函数调用次数 + 存储量计费。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Replicache</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按开发者席位收费（$499/月/席位）。</li>\n<li>不按月活用户计费。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Yjs 自托管</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>服务器成本。</li>\n<li>工程师时间成本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"迁移路径\">迁移路径</h2><p><strong>从平台起步，规模扩大后迁移</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>从 Liveblocks 迁移到自建 Yjs 后端。</li>\n<li>迁移难度较高——内部协议有差异。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>反向迁移</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>从自建 Yjs 迁移到 Liveblocks。</li>\n<li>需要部分数据模型迁移。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>最佳实践</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>选择以 Yjs 为底层的方案。</li>\n<li>平台本身使用 Yjs（如 Liveblocks 底层就是 Yjs）。</li>\n<li>这样日后迁移路径更清晰。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"自托管与平台托管\">自托管与平台托管</h2><p><strong>平台托管的优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>几天内即可交付。</li>\n<li>无需担心扩容和可用性。</li>\n<li>专注于产品本身。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>平台托管的劣势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>成本随规模增长。</li>\n<li>存在厂商锁定风险。</li>\n<li>隐私和数据控制受限。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>自托管的优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>完全掌控。</li>\n<li>成本可预测。</li>\n<li>数据隐私有保障。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>自托管的劣势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要工程师投入。</li>\n<li>需要全天候运维。</li>\n<li>扩容复杂。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>建议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>初创阶段选择平台托管。</li>\n<li>成熟阶段如果成本增长过快，考虑迁移到自托管。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"开源替代方案\">开源替代方案</h2><p><strong>HocusPocus</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Yjs 服务端框架。</li>\n<li>可插拔的持久化层。</li>\n<li>完全免费。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>y-websocket-server</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Yjs 内置的简单服务端。</li>\n<li>不适合大规模生产环境。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Yjs + Cloudflare 自建</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>现代的自托管模式，结合边缘计算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 重新发明 CRDT</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>应直接使用 Yjs 等成熟库。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 在超大规模下使用付费平台</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>成本可能变得不可承受。</li>\n<li>应考虑切换到自托管方案。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 在没有工程团队的情况下自托管</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>运维负担过重。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 深度绑定单一厂商</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>迁移代价极高。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 不做成本预测</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>容易遭遇账单惊吓。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战建议\">实战建议</h2><p><strong>1. 从 Liveblocks（React 项目）或 PartyKit（边缘项目）起步</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>快速交付产品。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 使用 Yjs 作为底层</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>降低未来迁移难度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 尽早估算成本</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>模拟百万月活用户的定价。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 提前规划迁移路径</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>避免被锁定后措手不及。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 测试多平台兼容性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>覆盖移动端 + 桌面端 + 浏览器。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"真实案例\">真实案例</h2><p><strong>Liveblocks 客户</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>大量初创公司。</li>\n<li>部分中型企业。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>PartyKit</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cloudflare 生态项目。</li>\n<li>边缘原生应用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Convex</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>全栈实时应用。</li>\n<li>以实时查询为核心的产品。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Yjs 自托管</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Linear、Notion（定制化实现）、Figma（完全自研）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"未来趋势\">未来趋势</h2><p><strong>行业趋势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>平台间竞争加剧。</li>\n<li>使用成本持续下降。</li>\n<li>边缘实时计算成为主流。</li>\n<li>AI 智能体协作模式正在涌现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>值得关注</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Liveblocks 功能演进方向。</li>\n<li>PartyKit 稳定性和生态成熟度。</li>\n<li>Cloudflare 实时计算能力的扩展。</li>\n<li>开源替代方案的发展。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>现代协作平台将协作功能的开发周期从数月缩短到数天。Liveblocks 专注 React 生态，提供预构建 Hooks（useOthers / useMyPresence / useStorage），集成 Yjs，采用托管模式，费用为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>200</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>千月活用户，通过</mtext><mi>a</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>服务端端点进行认证。</mtext><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>基于</mtext><mi>C</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mtext>边缘的持久对象，开源可自托管，有免费额度。</mtext><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mtext>提供全栈实时数据库</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>无服务器函数</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>实时查询，通过</mtext><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mtext>自动管理数据订阅。</mtext><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mtext>是同步引擎，数据存储在本地</mtext><mi>I</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi><mtext>，通过推送</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>拉取机制同步，内置乐观更新，按开发者席位收费</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30-200/千月活用户，通过 authorize() 服务端端点进行认证。PartyKit 基于 Cloudflare 边缘的持久对象，开源可自托管，有免费额度。Convex 提供全栈实时数据库 + 无服务器函数 + 实时查询，通过 useQuery / useMutation 自动管理数据订阅。Replicache 是同步引擎，数据存储在本地 IndexedDB，通过推送/拉取机制同步，内置乐观更新，按开发者席位收费</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">千月活用户，通过</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">服务端端点进行认证。</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">基于</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">df</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">边缘的持久对象，开源可自托管，有免费额度。</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">提供全栈实时数据库</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">无服务器函数</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实时查询，通过</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">自动管理数据订阅。</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">是同步引擎，数据存储在本地</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，通过推送</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">拉取机制同步，内置乐观更新，按开发者席位收费</span></span></span></span></span>499/月，后端无关且无厂商锁定。Pusher / Ably 提供实时消息通道的订阅/发布功能（无 CRDT 支持），每百万消息 $50-500。Yjs 自建方案提供完全控制权，配合 y-websocket 或 HocusPocus 服务器，开源但需要自行管理扩容。</p>\n<p>决策框架的核心思路：Liveblocks 适合 React + 预构建 + 托管需求；PartyKit 适合 Cloudflare 边缘 + 开源偏好；Convex 适合全栈 + 实时查询；Replicache 适合本地优先 + 自定义后端；Pusher/Ably 适合纯消息推送场景；Yjs 自建适合需要完全控制且有工程团队的场景。在自托管与平台托管之间的抉择中，建议初创阶段使用平台托管快速验证产品，成熟后根据成本增长情况考虑迁移到自托管。选择以 Yjs 为底层的方案可以让未来的迁移路径更加顺畅。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Liveblocks 与协作平台","id":"liveblocks-与协作平台"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Liveblocks","id":"liveblocks"},{"level":2,"text":"PartyKit","id":"partykit"},{"level":2,"text":"Convex","id":"convex"},{"level":2,"text":"Replicache","id":"replicache"},{"level":2,"text":"Pusher / Ably","id":"pusher-ably"},{"level":2,"text":"Yjs 自建方案","id":"yjs-自建方案"},{"level":2,"text":"决策框架","id":"决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"定价对比","id":"定价对比"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移路径","id":"迁移路径"},{"level":2,"text":"自托管与平台托管","id":"自托管与平台托管"},{"level":2,"text":"开源替代方案","id":"开源替代方案"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实战建议","id":"实战建议"},{"level":2,"text":"真实案例","id":"真实案例"},{"level":2,"text":"未来趋势","id":"未来趋势"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"服务器架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/production-ready/server-architecture"},"next":{"title":"实时协作应用测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/production-ready/testing-realtime"}}